Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
ListenAddress ::
HostKey /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid
UsePAM yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitRootLogin no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
StrictModes yes
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
LogLevel VERBOSE

# The dedicated interactive user keeps keyboard-interactive enabled (the harness
# forces and verifies it) while also accepting password callbacks for Tmds.Ssh,
# whose 0.23 API does not expose the server's keyboard-interactive prompt packet.
